  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "In the Unity Essentials pathway, you'll learn these essentials of the Unity Editor:\n\n\u2022 More about the Unity Editor interface\n\u2022 Navigating in 3D space to change your view of a scene\n\u2022 Working with GameObjects\n\u2022 3D and 2D physics to make objects move, fall, and collide\n\u2022 Audio and sound effects\n\u2022 Scripting to control your game"
